# Data Quality Gate (DQG) Rules

## Hard invariants
1. KronosEngine.predict() MUST call dqg.run() before model inference
2. If dqg.status != DQGStatus.PASS, raise DQGFailureError and stop
3. HeadlessRunner._on_candle_close() MUST skip symbols that fail DQG with logging
4. API layer MUST return HTTP 422 with DQG report if DQG fails
5. DQG report MUST be stored in Redis for UI consumption

## Check criticality
- min_history: CRITICAL
- coverage: CRITICAL
- no_critical_gaps: CRITICAL
- ohlcv_valid: CRITICAL
- lookback_ok: CRITICAL
- no_outliers: WARNING
- staleness: CRITICAL in HEADLESS/VISUAL; skip in BACKTEST/TRAIN

## When modifying DQG checks
- Add a unit test in tests/data_quality/ for every new check
- Thresholds go in config/base.yaml, never hardcoded
- CRITICAL check changes require UI DQGStatus updates
